rl":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5793,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:39:14Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-09-25T19:53:50Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:10Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110909","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110909","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110909.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110909.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Rendering feature proposal: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13271\r\n## Add INSTANCE_MATRIX spacial vertex built-in to reduce memory usage\r\n### Motivation\r\nCurrently, Godot's MultiMesh requires a transform buffer (either 2D or 3D) for all instances, even in cases where no per-instance transforms are needed, such as when instance positions are calculated programmatically. This forces unnecessary memory allocation of inaccessible transform data (8 floats for 2D or 12 for 3D per instance), which can be significant for high-instance-count scenarios.\r\n### Changes\r\nThis PR introduces INSTANCE_MATRIX as a built-in for the spacial shaders, allowing users to reinterpret MultiMesh transform data. This can halve or more the memory footprint for transform-less use cases, benefiting memory-constrained games or mobile targets. If INSTANCE_MATRIX is used in gdshader it will no longer be included in the model matrix via the INSTANCE_MATRIX_USED macro.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110909/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110909/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}